  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f69c6b1f1e1fc2c4b9a85c7696ada520, type: 3}
  m_Name: AfterOffice3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogSO
  replics:
  - Abigail.
  - Huh? Yeah?..
  - Please get out of the briefing room.
  - "I\u2019m working here too\u2026 and technically I\u2019m acting as management,
    you know."
  - "Yeah, but you\u2019re blocking the big screen. And I\u2019d like to watch what
    I\u2019m watching\u2026 alone."
  - "What are you watching?!\u2026"
  - "\u2026."
  - OH MY GOD.
  - "I knew it\u2026"
  - YOU HOOKED THE SCREEN TO A GOVERNMENT SATELLITE?! CAN YOU ZOOM IN ON THE MARIANA
    TRENCH?
  - I WANNA SEE THE WAVES IN REAL TIME!
  - "Leave. If you want to look at things you like \u2014 figure it out yourself.
    Don\u2019t touch me."
  - "So we\u2019re not looking for penguins either?\u2026"
  - "When you talk about yourself, don\u2019t associate it with me. And don\u2019t
    use \u201Cwe\u201D about you and me ever again. "
  - "I thought since you called me by my name \u2014 you wanted to make up."
  - "People here aren\u2019t used to callsigns yet\u2026 and you\u2019re always so
    strict with callsigns\u2026 so I thought it meant something."
  - "I used your name because it gets your attention faster, and I\u2019m trying
    to remove you from my \u201Cradius\u201D as efficiently as possible."
  - "Right\u2026 well judging by this, your love for penguins still hasn\u2019t gone
    away\u2026"
  - "For penguins \u2014 no. For you \u2014 never existed."
